title: blacksmith
---
<<fade_out YarnCommands 0>><<wait 1>><<picture YarnCommands placeholder>><<fade_in YarnCommands 1>><<bloom_text YarnCommands "The Blacksmith">>
You come across a sturdy tent set up beside the road.
The clang of metal draws your attention, and you find a blacksmith working over a glowing forge.
Blacksmith: "Ho there! Come closer, traveler. I've got wares that'll serve you well."
He wipes his brow and proudly presents the weapons and armor arranged around his tent.
Blacksmith: "Take a look. Something here will definitely catch your eye."
<<jump blacksmith_choice>>
===

title: blacksmith_choice
---
-> Buy new equipment #paneldetails=Lose_100_Gold._Gain_1_Proficiency
    <<if gold() >= 150>>
        <<change_gold -150>><<change_proficiency 1>>
        <<sfx YarnCommands buy>>
        After some deliberation, you select a piece of equipment that catches your eye.
        You place the chosen equipment on the table, alongside the appropriate sum of Gold.
        The blacksmith gives it a final inspection before handing it over, satisfied with another sale.
        <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
    <<else>>
        <<jump blacksmith_broke>>
    <<endif>>
-> Window shop 
    You look over the blacksmith's wares without buying anything.
    The blacksmith watches you closely, growing more irritated with every passing moment.
    Eventually, you thank him and move on.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
-> [gold]Examine the unfinished swords[/gold] <<if insight() >= 1>> #paneldetails=Spend_1_Insight._Gain_2_Proficiency._Gain_30_Vigor.
    <<spend_insight 1>>
    You notice several unfinished crafts resting near the forge.
    You point them out and offer to complete them in exchange for one.
    The blacksmith studies your suggestion, then breaks into a grin.
    Blacksmith: "Oh? Think you got what it takes?"
    He examines you for a moment before shrugging.
    Blacksmith: "Well, I'm not one to turn down free labor. Go on, then. Let's see what you've got."
    <<change_proficiency 2>><<change_vigor 30>>
    You get to work, carefully refining the blades until they are fit for use. The blacksmith watches your technique with growing interest.
    Blacksmith: "Impressive! Would you consider becoming my apprentice?"
    You politely decline his offer.
    You set aside the finished swords and take one for yourself, the blacksmith sends you off with a hearty smile and a grateful wave.
    <<hide_speaker_frame YarnCommands>><<wait 1>><<fade_out YarnCommands 2>><<load_map_scene>>
===

title: blacksmith_broke
---
<<sfx YarnCommands broke>>
Blacksmith: "The finest gear requires the finest gold. Sorry, traveler."
He folds his arms and waits for you to make another choice.
<<jump blacksmith_choice>>
===
